      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 12 — Design Review Pipeline\nSPECIALIST AGENT execution, one execution per task.\n\n**Agents:** Design Critic (+ Typography, Spacing, Color, Mobile UI checkers) and Image/Visual Analysis. The Design Critic can reject work and send it back for revision.\n\nStart → pre-execution tools (real audits) → Model Router → Context Builder (only what this task needs) → Key Manager / 55 RPM limiter → NVIDIA call → structured-output review (schema, files, sub-agents, review gates) → next stage. Failures go to the Error / Retry Manager.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
